    {
      "name": "places/ChIJp7wM6dmLaS4RUixdISvxVLk/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toT1psVk1lbEZoU1hkT1ltRlVXRTgwYnkxeWVXYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Kopinya enak, I'd like to appreciate their Americano, 5/5. I also tried the kopi kawan lama (it has stronger taste of coffee yet still creamy) 4.5/5. I love the warmth from waiters and barista. The barista desribed their coffee pretty well.\n\nMinus:\n- Limited amount of parking area\n- Limited option of snack\n- They don't sell main course/makanan berat.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
